      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two new cancer patient information CD-ROMs extend the personal stories within virtual environments model of cancer patient information developed for Breast Cancer Lighthouse. Cancer Pain Retreat and Cancer Prevention Park: Games for Life are intended to inform and inspire users in an emotionally calming and intimately informative manner. The software offers users an experience--of visiting a virtual place and meeting and talking with patients and health care professionals."},
